WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.760
On your phone, open the App Store or Google Play and search for

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.770
Claude, by Anthropic.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:08.910
Install it, open it, and sign in yourself.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:12.660
Then paste your email helper into a new chat and send.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.400
Projects work best on a computer,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.149
so add that later if you like.

